{"assets":["/statement-assets/f876798b26cf218cb1293559008adcca35b77fcb9365ff881ecf57e73c1b6205.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"746","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"F. Music in Car"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Sasha reaches the work by car. It takes exactly "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" minutes. On his way he listens to music. All songs in his playlist go one by one, after listening to the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th song Sasha gets a pleasure which equals "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai"},{"kind":"text","text":". The "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th song lasts for "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ti"},{"kind":"text","text":" minutes. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Before the beginning of his way Sasha turns on some song "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x"},{"kind":"text","text":" and then he listens to the songs one by one: at first, the song "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x"},{"kind":"text","text":", then the song "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(x + 1)"},{"kind":"text","text":", then the song number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(x + 2)"},{"kind":"text","text":", and so on. He listens to songs until he reaches the work or until he listens to the last song in his playlist. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Sasha can listen to each song to the end or "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"partly"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second case he listens to the song for integer number of minutes, at least half of the song's length. Formally, if the length of the song equals "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"d"},{"kind":"text","text":" minutes, Sasha listens to it for no less than "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/f876798b26cf218cb1293559008adcca35b77fcb9365ff881ecf57e73c1b6205.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" minutes, then he immediately switches it to the next song (if there is such). For example, if the length of the song which Sasha wants to "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"partly"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" listen to, equals "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"5"},{"kind":"text","text":" minutes, then he should listen to it for at least "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3"},{"kind":"text","text":" minutes, if the length of the song equals "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"8"},{"kind":"text","text":" minutes, then he should listen to it for at least "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"4"},{"kind":"text","text":" minutes."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It takes no time to switch a song."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Sasha wants to listen "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"partly"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" no more than "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"w"},{"kind":"text","text":" songs. If the last listened song plays for less than half of its length, then Sasha doesn't get pleasure from it and that song is not included to the list of "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"partly"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" listened songs. It is not allowed to skip songs. A pleasure from a song does not depend on the listening mode, for the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th song this value equals "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Help Sasha to choose such "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x"},{"kind":"text","text":" and no more than "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"w"},{"kind":"text","text":" songs for "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"partial"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" listening to get the maximum pleasure. Write a program to find the maximum pleasure Sasha can get from the listening to the songs on his way to the work."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains three integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"w"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ w ≤ n ≤ 2·105"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ k ≤ 2·109"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the number of songs in the playlist, the number of songs Sasha can listen to "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"partly"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" and time in minutes which Sasha needs to reach work. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" positive integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a1, a2, ..., an"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ ai ≤ 104"},{"kind":"text","text":"), where "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai"},{"kind":"text","text":" equals the pleasure Sasha gets after listening to the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th song."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The third line contains "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" positive integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t1, t2, ..., tn"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2 ≤ ti ≤ 104"},{"kind":"text","text":"), where "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ti"},{"kind":"text","text":" equals the length of the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th song in minutes."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print the maximum pleasure Sasha can get after listening to the songs on the way to work. "}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"7 2 11\n3 4 3 5 1 4 6\n7 7 3 6 5 3 9\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"12\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"8 4 20\n5 6 4 3 7 5 4 1\n10 12 5 12 14 8 5 8\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"19\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"1 1 5\n6\n9\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"6\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"1 1 3\n4\n7\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"0\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first example Sasha needs to start listening from the song number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2"},{"kind":"text","text":". He should listen to it "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"partly"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" (for "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"4"},{"kind":"text","text":" minutes), then listen to the song number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3"},{"kind":"text","text":" to the end (for "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3"},{"kind":"text","text":" minutes) and then "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"partly"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" listen to the song number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"4"},{"kind":"text","text":" (for "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3"},{"kind":"text","text":" minutes). After listening to these songs Sasha will get pleasure which equals "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"4 + 3 + 5 = 12"},{"kind":"text","text":". Sasha will not have time to listen to the song number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"5"},{"kind":"text","text":" because he will spend "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"4 + 3 + 3 = 10"},{"kind":"text","text":" minutes listening to songs number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"4"},{"kind":"text","text":" and only "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" minute is left after that. "}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"F","problemCode":"746F","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/746/problem/F"}